title: Party Organizationsn
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: party_organizations_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; party_organizations_timer = 6;
card-image: img/Party_org.jpg
max-visits: 6
#subtitle: Outside of electoral politics, the PPS runs a social world onto itself.

= Party Organizations

In addition to being a political party, the PPS is a social world onto itself, with a vast array of associated organizations which serve the social needs of their members from cradle to grave.

- @newspapers: Fund more newspapers and journalists.
- @welfare1: Fund more mutual aid and welfare programs.
- @welfare2: Fund programs targeting rural areas.
- @culture: Fund sports leagues, educational, and cultural programs.
- @youth: We have the reputation of being a party for old men. Support the youth organizations.
- @nothing: Do not increase funding for any program.
- @easy_discard

@newspapers
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; media_timer = 0
go-to: media

# TODO: differing outcomes based on whether you've seen media, and what kind of media you've supported.


@welfare1
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; unemployed_pps += 6*(1 - dissent)

We have funded programs targeting the unemployed, providing them aid and welfare.

@welfare2
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources 
on-arrival: resources -= 1; peasants_pps += 6*(1 - dissent)

We have funded programs targeting the burderned landowners, providing them aid and welfare.

@culture
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; internationalist_dissent -= 6; center_dissent -= 6; nationalist_dissent -= 6

It is not enough for the PPS to solely be a political party. We fund schools and libraries that are crucial to our members' lives. Funding these organizations makes our members more committed to the party, even when our policies might not be to their liking.

@youth
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; internationalist_strength += 5; unemployed_pps += 4*(1 - dissent)

Our new youth members flock to the left wings of the party.

@nothing

We do not fund any party organizations.

- @return: Continue...
